<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23893" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in-sŏlūbĭlis</span></b> ,
			e, adj., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>that cannot be loosed</i>, <i>indissoluble</i> (post-Aug.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vinculum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Macr. Somn. Scip. 1, 6, §
				24</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">colligatio,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib.</span></i>
			 § 28.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<i>That cannot be paid</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">beneticium, creditum insolubile est,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Ben. 4, 12, 1</span></i>
			.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<i>That cannot be refuted</i>, <i>incontestable</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">signum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Quint.
					5, 9, 3</span></i>
			.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>C.</b>
			<i>That cannot be destroyed</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aeternitas,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">App. Asclep. p. 100, 37</span></i>
			.— <i>Adv.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">insŏlūbĭlĭter</span></b> ,
				<i>indissolubly</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vinciri,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Macr. Somn. Scip. 1, 6</span></i>
			; Aug. Civ. Dei, 21, 10.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
